THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This file documents third-party software used by ironrdp-cef-server when
the `runtime` or `media-fixture` feature is enabled.

================================================================================

OpenH264 Integration Notice

ironrdp-cef-server uses the openh264 crate (https://crates.io/crates/openh264)
compiled from bundled OpenH264 source (`features = ["source"]`) to decode
H.264 `MS-RDPECAM` camera samples and to encode `MS-RDPEGFX` `AVC420` desktop
surfaces when negotiated with the RDP client.

